# Wordflow programming rules

1. NO CONTEXT / NO HANDOFF → do not implement.
2. COPY-FIRST: search existing code (name + component_catalog) before GENERATE.
3. Priority: COPY/MOVE → LINK → PATCH → ADAPT → GENERATE LAST.
4. After implement: forensic 4-pass contract; only VerdictAuthority may PASS.
5. AI output is not proof.
6. Evidence must reference path/test/commit.
7. Prefer files ≤800 LOC; project LOC unlimited.
8. Never claim DONE if code_path/programming gates blocked.
